docTR — Apache License 2.0
    https://github.com/mindee/doctr
    Copyright (c) 2021 Mindee

    Adapted algorithms:
      packages/xian-vl/src/xian/ocr/grouping.py   DocumentBuilder._sort_boxes
          (reading order) and _resolve_lines (line assembly).  The line-break
          distance is re-expressed relative to the local median box height
          rather than to page width, because the input here is a screen region
          of arbitrary size rather than a document page.


EasyOCR — Apache License 2.0
    https://github.com/JaidedAI/EasyOCR
    Copyright (c) 2020 Jaided AI

    Adapted algorithms:
      packages/xian-vl/src/xian/ocr/grouping.py   get_paragraph — the free
          merge of boxes into paragraphs, including its right-to-left mode.
          The merge radius is derived from the median line height rather than
          the maximum, so a single oversized box cannot set the radius for a
          whole screen.


